Patch to V-JEPA 2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/vjepa2), commit 204698b45b3712590f06245fbfba32d3be539812.
Original code: Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Licensed under the MIT License.

Changes: restore the public weight URL and add an optional `checkpoint_path`
argument so the ViT-g encoder can be loaded from a local checkpoint (needed on
compute nodes without internet access).

Apply from the vjepa2 repo root:  git apply vjepa2-checkpoint-path.patch

